Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}New Teammate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 22
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the ones causing trouble in my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people attacked us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he be Yaozu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you actually know my younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s elsewhere right now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am his elder brother. My name is Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My men have had a taste of your skills; you’re pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you cooperate with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,all the treasures in here will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but we’re not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve suddenly got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have important business right now; please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some misunderstanding here. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No amount of delicious food can stop us from wanting to find our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely understand your desire to find your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am looking for my daughter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,An incident recently occurred at an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports state that the incident involved several people, including Blue Scarf and Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you bear to see my young daughter…by this person…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did this news report take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re looking for this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this person a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My men saw him with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But then a sandstorm hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and they lost track of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your friend is with my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you really must help me find them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because some dangerous people might harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially that man named Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If my daughter—or your friend—falls into his hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the chances of survival would be slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He sounds just like Chay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn’t the time to think about such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we need to protect Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. Since we share the same goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,let me entrust you with a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me defeat Cha Erlang and save my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes, besides an endless supply of food and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you will also become my heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly, we can save our Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a vehicle for your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it going, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting, Boss—everything is going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll be bringing the water back right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll reward you handsomely when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, Boss. Thank you, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, this is yours, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Boss will definitely value us more after this trip back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a noise just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have misheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s someone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check the back and see what’s happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the shaking just now knock the door open?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone really is stealing water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I suck any more out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you sneak a drink of my water, but you’re even taking some to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But you seem a bit different from Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, thanks for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about running.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the water down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the ball back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re welcome. Mr. Slowy put me in charge of guarding the Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding the Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can protect Goats’ Village just like the Defenders do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You really…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do to Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m giving him a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give him a flower to encourage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, what brings you to Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to Wolf Fortress to look for Uncle Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Wolnie said that both Uncle Wolffy and Weslie had gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I came to Goats’ Village to see if you had any new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi and Sparky have already gone to look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re the good guys…you…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, whenever I get nervous, I just want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He even took so much water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good kids remember not to point random, strange objects at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And also…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re clearly a doll—how can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you look a lot like a friend from my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a long story regarding this doll body of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just say…you could understand it as me not being from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not from around here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I’m not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not from this world either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from a world called “Lüyouyou”.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift appeared in my world and swept me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Life here is incredibly hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ve never given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’ve been waiting for a chance to go back and save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,To get powerful weapons, I have to acquire more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When you went to haul water earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I snuck onto your vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What I did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But without water, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry; I’ll accept whatever consequences come my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you realize you were wrong, at least there’s still a chance to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve found the water thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole all the water from my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How is my family supposed to survive without water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole water from so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I only took a little bit from each person…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking it is taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take him back and interrogate him properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the water back to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They want the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I complete the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just get the map to the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can’t just leave Planie to his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t thinking of meddling in other people’s business, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie made a mistake, and I want to help him make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about our reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wants to survive and save his world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll compensate you for the water on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he’d compensate us for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares who pays? As long as we get the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t do things like that again; it’s wrong and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? What are your plans for the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re both in the same boat—two lost souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you just tag along with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, even though you’re just a ragdoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not a ragdoll; I’m Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the Wolffy from his world be just like I used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But you’re very different from the Wolffy in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the first good person I’ve met here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, good guy Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just having one good person like me isn’t enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more good people to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better figure out what to do ourselves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So much of the water is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to explain this to Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to try this method.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I knew I picked the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, you did a great job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren’t bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute—who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting, Boss: we ran into him on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nowhere to go right now; he’s just wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Anyone lost in this wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,is someone I’ll save if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, you have such a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, you are truly wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll have the first drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there so much sand in the water? What’s going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.03,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Guangzong? Did he know you were coming to fetch water and deliberately sabotage it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See how I deal with you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Boss, didn’t you say you were going to give us a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly—the reward is for you to drink your fill of this water along with everyone else.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
